    "description": "credit: PeeryHD: https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198874822787/\r\n\r\nUpdated his code to work with newer API versions!\r\n\r\nTurn your desktop into a live Air Traffic Control station. This wallpaper displays real-time flight data in a sleek, retro-modern radar style.\r\nFeatures:\r\n- 📡 Live Tracking: Real-time aircraft positions (10s refresh).\r\n- 🌍 Global: Set any location (Latitude/Longitude) in the settings.\r\n- 🖱️ Interactive: Click aircraft in list for full flight details.\r\n- ⚙️ Customizable: Adjust scan radius, filters (altitude/speed), and visuals.\r\nCredits:\r\n- Data provided by api.airplanes.live via ADSB One.\r\n- Developed with the assistance of Artificial Intelligence (AI), beause its the result of a little bit of vibecoding.\r\n\r\nFeedback and requests welcome! Let me know what you think.",
